/* Generated by scripts/generate_kernels.wl (vslice): the d2R components on the ingoing (v) slice,
 *   exp(i m3 Omega r*) d2R_i = sum_k R2C_i(l3, m3, ...)[k] * V_ik,  V_ik from R2V_i,
 * taking the regular (v, r)-frame fields a_j of the two first-order modes (see the generator)
 * and returning real (Gr) and imaginary (Gi) planes; the series overloads (one point) return the
 * first three Taylor coefficients in r - 2M (Taylor3, r = 2M + x). The coupling coefficients R2C_i, R2_NC
 * and R2_NC_MAX are those of R2G.h. */
